The release public keys the runtime supervisor trusts to sign the root helper
(internal/rootswap). Each is an ed25519 key as a PEM "PUBLIC KEY" block, the
output of `aerolvm-rootd-sign -genkey` or `openssl pkey -pubout`. Text outside
the blocks is ignored. Any key listed here can sign a helper that runs as root
on every node whose runtime image is built from this file, so a change here is
reviewed like a change to the supervisor itself, and it reaches running nodes
only with a new runtime image.

No key is listed yet: until one is, the supervisor refuses every staged helper.
